{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是 library_normalized_log1p，即已经过文库归一化和 log1p 变换。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Scanpy 1.11.2 文档明确说明：flavor='seurat_v3' 时期望输入是 count 数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，当前 library_normalized_log1p 矩阵不能直接作为 seurat_v3 的输入；它不满足该 flavor 对 count 数据的输入要求。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "seurat_v3 的计算机制是先对每个基因做带正则化标准差的 z-score 标准化，再计算标准化后方差并按该方差排序。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "First, the data are standardized (i.e., z-score normalization per feature) with a regularized standard deviation. Next, the normalized variance is computed as the variance of each gene after the transformation. Genes are ranked by the normalized variance."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你已提供 n_top_genes=2000；在 seurat_v3 下该参数是必需的，因此这一条件已经满足。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "n_top_genes\n        Number of highly-variable genes to keep. Mandatory if `flavor='seurat_v3'`."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你已提供 batch_key=null；文档中关于 seurat_v3 与 seurat_v3_paper 的批次排序差异仅在 batch_key 不为 None 时适用，因此当前条件下不涉及该差异。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Only if `batch_key` is not `None`, the two flavors differ: For `flavor='seurat_v3'`, genes are first sorted by the median (across batches) rank, with ties broken by the number of batches a gene is a HVG."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "必要的下一步是提供或恢复未对数化的原始 counts 矩阵，再以该 counts 矩阵作为 seurat_v3 的输入；不能假设当前数据中已经存在 counts 层。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
